---
import Base from "@/layouts/Base.astro";
const targetUrl = "https://sage.org.ai/";
---

<Base
  title="IntelliStream"
  meta_title="IntelliStream | Redirecting to SAGE"
  description="IntelliStream homepage now forwards SAGE visitors to the canonical SAGE product and documentation site."
  canonical={targetUrl}
  noindex={true}
>
  <section class="section pb-10 pt-24">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl rounded-3xl border border-gray-200 bg-white px-8 py-16 text-center shadow-lg">
        <p class="mb-4 inline-flex rounded-full bg-blue-50 px-4 py-1 text-sm font-semibold text-blue-700">
          Unified entry point
        </p>
        <h1 class="font-primary text-4xl font-bold md:text-5xl">
          IntelliStream 的 SAGE 入口已统一到 sage.org.ai
        </h1>
        <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg text-gray-600">
          为减少首页分散与重复信息，SAGE 的产品介绍、安装入口和公开文档现在统一使用
          <a class="font-semibold text-blue-700 underline" href={targetUrl}>sage.org.ai</a>
          作为唯一主入口。
        </p>

        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-4 sm:flex-row">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href={targetUrl}>进入 SAGE</a>
          <a class="btn btn-outline-primary" href="https://github.com/intellistream">查看 GitHub 组织</a>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-10 grid gap-4 text-left md:grid-cols-3">
          <div class="rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 p-5">
            <p class="mb-2 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-500">Product</p>
            <p class="font-semibold">sage.org.ai</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600">SAGE 官方产品首页与文档主入口。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 p-5">
            <p class="mb-2 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-500">Organization</p>
            <p class="font-semibold">intellistream.github.io</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600">组织域名保留为轻量入口页，避免再承担重复产品首页职责。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 p-5">
            <p class="mb-2 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-500">Code</p>
            <p class="font-semibold">github.com/intellistream</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600">源码、仓库、Issue、PR 与发布协作入口。</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="mt-8 text-sm text-gray-500">页面将在 1.5 秒后自动跳转。如果没有跳转，请点击上方按钮。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<script is:inline>
  window.setTimeout(() => {
    window.location.replace("https://sage.org.ai/");
  }, 1500);
</script>

<noscript>
  <meta http-equiv="refresh" content="0; url=https://sage.org.ai/" />
</noscript>
